{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>After these things.</b> After Avram killed these kings, he feared lest the remaining nations gather against him, as it is written regarding Yaakov: 'they shall gather themselves together against me, and slay me,' etc. The Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: <b>Fear not, Avram</b> — from the kinsmen of these kings; if you rescued Lot from their hand, I am a shield for you against them. And not only that, but <b>your reward shall be very great</b> — because you trusted in Me more than what the king of Sodom wished to give you, and because you exerted yourself to rescue your kinsmen."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:15.458378215Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}